The '''Lost Precursor City''' is a location in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, more specifically the {{Zone|Precursor Remnants}}.

{{ZoneText|Ancient machines protecting ancient cities that hide ancient secrets.}}

== Purpose ==
The {{Item|Sapphire Crystal}} can be obtained. {{Green|6}} [[Automaton Parts]] are required to claim the crystal, each randomly dropped by killing {{MobSprite|Automaton}} or obtained by opening chests in the {{Zone|Precursor Remnants}}. Delivering all six parts or a {{Item|Precursor Apparatus}} to {{NPCSprite|Professor Robot}} will unlock the door next to him, allowing access to the {{Item|Sapphire Crystal}}.

== NPCs ==
{{Location NPCs}}

== Trivia ==
* Right-clicking on the blocks in the door to the [[Sapphire Crystal]] will cause them to disappear, although the Crystal will not be claimable unless you give all parts to {{NPCSprite|Professor Robot}}. The only use it has is to kill the Automatons spawned in the Sapphire Crystal claiming location.
* The door to the [[Sapphire Crystal]] doesn't reappear, even if the crystal is claimed and placed at the [[Crystal Nucleus]].
* There is a room with {{Item|Melon}}s that can be broken, however they only give {{skill|Farming|XP}}, no drops or collection.

